# ==============================================================================
# FARSHBAZAR ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' for local builds.
# In CI/CD (GitHub Actions), secrets are injected from repository secrets into .env.
# NEVER commit the actual '.env' file or production keys into Git version control.
# ==============================================================================

# --- AI & Vision Services ---
# Required for Gemini AI / Vision smart analysis:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --- Telephony & SMS Gateway (Kavenegar / Ghasedak / Magfa) ---
# Used for Iranian Mobile OTP dispatch (6-digit verification code):
# SMS_GATEWAY_API_KEY=your_sms_gateway_token_here
# SMS_GATEWAY_SENDER_NUMBER=1000xxxx
# SMS_GATEWAY_OTP_TEMPLATE=farshbazar_verify_code

# --- Shahkar Identity Verification (Telecom & CRA Gateway) ---
# Official SIM ownership matching National ID with Mobile MSISDN:
# SHAHKAR_SERVICE_API_KEY=your_authorized_shahkar_token
# SHAHKAR_SERVICE_ENDPOINT=https://api.pishkhan.ir/v1/services/shahkar

# --- Cafe Bazaar In-App Billing (Poolkey) ---
# Base64 RSA Public Key obtained from Cafe Bazaar Developer Console for verification:
# BAZAAR_PURCHASE_PUBLIC_KEY=MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEA...

# --- Android Release Keystore Signing ---
# Used by Gradle 'release' signingConfig (app/build.gradle.kts):
# KEYSTORE_PATH=/path/to/my-upload-key.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=your_store_password_here
# KEY_ALIAS=upload
# KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password_here
